About CredoScreening

CredoScreening is building the compliance infrastructure for a digital-first world. We help businesses screen individuals and organizations against 1.2M+ entities from OFAC, global sanctions, PEP databases, Interpol, and 80+ watchlists — all in under 3 seconds.

Our platform also provides identity verification with government ID scanning, facial matching, and liveness detection across 200+ countries. From fintechs to financial institutions, insurance companies to crypto platforms, regulated businesses rely on CredoScreening to stay compliant without slowing down.

We're a lean, fast-moving team with a product that sells itself — but we need someone who can open doors, build relationships, and close deals across industries that need compliance screening yesterday. A sister company of TrustCredo, we're growing rapidly and looking for driven people to join us.

About the Role

We're looking for a high-energy Account Executive to drive new business across our target markets: fintech, financial services, insurance, crypto, SaaS, real estate, and professional services. You'll own the full sales cycle — from prospecting to close — selling a product that compliance teams genuinely need and that practically demos itself.

This isn't enterprise sales with 18-month cycles. Our price point ($0.99/check) and self-serve free tier mean you're often closing within weeks. The best reps here will combine outbound hustle with a consultative approach, helping prospects understand how CredoScreening fits into their compliance workflow.

You'll be one of the first sales hires — which means you'll have an outsized impact on how we sell, who we sell to, and how fast we grow.

